    ↩️ 🔤🎚 with 🔡🔤
  🍉

  🐇❗️ 🎛 x ⚪️ ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    ↩️ 🔤🎛 with ⚪️🔤
  🍉
  🐇❗️ 🎛 n 🔢 ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    ↩️ 🔤🎛 with 🔢🔤
  🍉
